      },
      "narration": "Alright, this one's for you if you've ever thought, \"Why would I learn S-Q-L when ChatGPT can just write it for me?\" Totally fair question. By the end of this lesson, you'll see exactly how A-I generated S-Q-L can look perfectly clean and still target the wrong rows for deletion. The fix is simple, and you'll know it cold by the time we're done.",
