    {
      "id": "e_close",
      "time_offset_ms": 303283,
      "type": "zoom_result",
      "target": "sql_viewer",
      "params": {},
      "narration": "Here's the whole lesson in one sentence. Always SELECT before you DELETE. The A-I's query looked fine on the surface, but when we checked the results, two out of three rows were customers we shouldn't be deleting. You don't need to be an S-Q-L expert. You just need to preview the results and ask, \"Does every row here actually belong on the chopping block?\" That one habit will save you from the scariest A-I mistakes.",
